          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.34,
          "end": 33.21,
          "en": "this tells CSS that I want to apply these styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.21,
          "end": 37.99,
          "en": "to every anchor tag, which has this CSS class on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.99,
          "end": 40.163,
          "en": "And if I do that and saved this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.12,
          "end": 43.84,
          "en": "you now notice Users is highlighted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.84,
          "end": 46.87,
          "en": "If I click on Teams that stays highlighted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.87,
          "end": 51.87,
          "en": "and that's how you can reflect on your page visually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 52.06,
          "end": 56.13,
          "en": "on your links, which link is currently active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 56.13,
          "end": 57.46,
          "en": "Now as a side note,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.46,
          "end": 60.51,
          "en": "you have two classes on their router-link-active,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.51,
          "end": 62.66,
          "en": "which I'm using for styling here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.66,
          "end": 66,
          "en": "but also router-link-exact-active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66,
          "end": 69.35,
          "en": "Now, the difference is that router-link-active",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.35,
          "end": 72.49,
          "en": "would also be applied to this item here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.49,
          "end": 76.92,
          "en": "If we had something like Teams, Team ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.92,
          "end": 81.15,
          "en": "So if we had some nested route to this route here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.15,
          "end": 83.48,
          "en": "now we have learned about nested routes yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.48,
          "end": 85.86,
          "en": "so for in a moment, we can just ignore that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.86,
          "end": 88.74,
          "en": "But the difference is that router-link-exact-active",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.74,
          "end": 91.21000000000001,
          "en": "will only be applied to the navigation item",
